  "goodToKnow": "Die Offenlegung is disclosure: die Offenlegung von Interessenkonflikten, Finanzen, Quellcode. Offenlegen means to disclose. After a 2021 scandal over face mask deals, rules for Bundestag members were tightened: they must now disclose side income above 1,000 euros a month or 3,000 a year. Companies must offenlegen their annual accounts in the Unternehmensregister. The opposite is die Geheimhaltung. Plural: die Offenlegungen."
